title: Rotfrontkämpferbund Membership Dwindles
subtitle: Our unpopularity has impaired the Rotfrontkämpferbund's recruitment ability.
view-if: rfb_militancy >= 0.1 and ((workers_kpd + unemployed_kpd) < ( workers_nsdap + workers_dnvp + (rfb_militancy*rfb_strength/))) and rfb_unpopularity_timer <= 0
new-page: true
tags: event
is-card: true
face-image: img/redfront.jpg

= Reichsbanner Membership Dwindles

Unfortunately, the RFB's effectiveness is dragged down by the KPD's unpopularity, as the workers aren't particularly enthusiastic about joining.

- @rfb_joever: Unfortunate.

@rfb_joever
on-arrival: rfb_strength *= 0.9; rfb_unpopularity_timer += 6

This will continue to be a problem if our popularity continues to flag.